    "description": "What: CE-2476 perception suite P6 (Sensing \u00a78.6e) - on bt-range a 'Red Walker' jogs west to east along the north wall of House A and stops short of its north-east corner; two passive Blue listeners stand just east of the house, 8-12 m round that corner; the house is always between them. Judge: his steps are heard, but only ROUND the house's corners: a place to look (D-8), never a place he is - no listener ever holds a straight hearing or a sighting of him. Fail: nobody hears him, or a listener believes a spot for him through the house. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh pe-steps-round-corner"
